WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.490
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The SCP Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:10.040
allowed to use “For The Emperor” as justification
for any decision.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.740
For starters, the SCP Foundation is independent
from the commands of any single nation.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.900
It is an autonomous non-profit organization,
and you know that.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.380
Secondly, the only country in the world that
still has an active Emperor is Japan - and

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:28.000
his role is purely ceremonial because Japan
is a constitutional monarchy.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.360
And just for the record, “For the O5 Council”
and “For The Administrator” are also unacceptable

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.340
unless the order you’re acting on actually
comes from them.

